OL,3,AIndian police accused of sexually
OL,4,Aharassing journalists at protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree female journalists have accused
OL,7,Fpolice officers in India of sexual
OL,8,Fharassment during street protests in
OL,9,Fthe capital Delhi.
OL,11,FThe claims were made on Saturday after
OL,12,Fthe force detained scores of young
OL,13,Fpeople calling for the resignation of
OL,14,Fthe chief election commissioner.
OL,16,FIn a post on social media, Delhi Police
OL,17,Fsaid its New Delhi District had
OL,18,Freceived the complaint, and it had been
OL,19,Ftransferred to its crime branch for a
OL,20,F"fair and impartial" inquiry.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
